      "prov:value": "The owner, 2026-09-20: &quot;this is also a SDLC process to be developed for testing a sample import into a KG (or generally structued data store), issues of data size, retention - what happens if data srouce goes away, copyright.&quot; General, not WHO-specific: IRIS is the worked instance, and who-iris/ is what this is exercised on.",
